    "language": "en",
    "md5": "9bc8555b4141a4bec8d6594882563781",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1937,
    "chunk_text": "The Book Studio revolutionises reading with first automated book vending machine\n\nFrom left: Digital Marketing Executives Hanah Rafeeq and Melani Pathiratne, Sector Head \u2013 Finance Pathum Sanjeewa, Deputy General Manager Nalinda Fernando, Assistant General Manager Lasitha Ekanayake, and CEO/Director Kushan Gunasekera\n\nThe Book Studio Ltd., has introduced Sri Lanka\u2019s first fully automated book vending machine, marking a significant innovation in the country\u2019s publishing and retail landscape.\n\nRedefining how readers can discover and purchase books with instant self-service, this landmark initiative represents a strategic synergy of technology and convenience, designed to make literature more accessible to the community.\n\nAligned with the core belief that \u201ceverywhere can be a reading space,\u201d this initiative supports holistic well-being by integrating a culture of learning and curiosity directly into everyday high-traffic environments. The automated unit allows readers to walk away with their selected read in an instant, bridging the gap between busy modern lifestyles and the simple pleasures of reading.\n\nCEO/Director Kushan Gunasekera said: \u201cIt gives us great pleasure to introduce this innovation to Sri Lanka via The Book Studio. This is a milestone in our journey and a testament to our vision for a more well-read Sri Lanka. By leveraging automated technology, we are making the act of discovering a new book as seamless and effortless as possible. Through this automated book vending machine, we have unveiled a new channel for schools, universities, banks, corporates, hospitals, and high-footfall locations to provide books, stationery, and learning essentials with convenience, visibility, and accessibility.\u201d\n\nThe Book Studio is committed to expanding the initiative islandwide. This launch marks the first step in a broader journey toward making reading fun, innovative, and effortless for everyone."
  },
