    "chunk_size_bytes": 1144,
    "chunk_text": "Scheduled for three, ended up doing seven\n\nSinger/entertainer Rajiv Sebastian was booked for three shows, in the UK, but ended up doing seven, and that\u2019s a huge vote of confidence from UK audiences/organisers.\n\nUsually that happens when the first gigs sell out, or get great word-of-mouth, and the organisers immediately move into action by adding extra dates to meet the demand.\n\nWell, it certainly did happen where Rajiv is concerned and that alone is a clear indication that everything went really well for Rajiv.\n\nBeing 36 years in the music scene, with his band The Clan, he is now working on putting together a special event to celebrate the anniversary, along with his fans, right here in Colombo.\n\n\u201cI want to make it a unique event, incorporating classics, calypso, pop and kaffringha (baila),\u201d said Rajiv.\n\nDescribed as a versatile vocal powerhouse, Rajiv Sebastian certainly has something special up his sleeves for local music lovers!\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
