    "description": "CanCham SL unveils strategy to deepen Canada-Sri Lanka economic ties",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/CanCham-SL-unveils-strategy-to-deepen-Canada-Sri-Lanka-economic-ties/34-792100",
